          "width": 216,
          "height": 168,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nSafety\nThe Range Safety Officer\nshall command\nultra-high-frequency (UHF)\ndestruct from outside\nMission Control until that\ncommand is safed after\nEarth orbit.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "land",
