          "y": 284,
          "width": 237,
          "height": 156,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nAir\nThe Lunar Module shall supply\noxygen, water, and lithium\nhydroxide for life support.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
