          "width": 230,
          "height": 156,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nGuide\nThe Lunar Module Primary\nGuidance system shall use\nlanding radar during descent\nand rendezvous radar during\nascent.",
